<Layout title="Privacy — The Curated Pick">
  <article class="prose wrap"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>A simpler visit.</h1><p>You can browse The Curated Pick without creating an account. This version has no account system, checkout, wishlist, advertising pixels, or site analytics. Search and category filters run in your browser. Your current filters appear in the page URL so you can return to or share a search; page requests containing those URLs may appear in hosting logs.</p><h2>Your display preference</h2><p>If you switch between light and dark mode, we save that preference in your browser's local storage. It is not used to identify or track you. You can remove it by clearing this website's browser data.</p><h2>Hosting and images</h2><p>Our hosting and image providers may process technical request information, such as IP addresses and browser information, to deliver and protect the website. Product images may be served from Supabase Storage or an image source chosen for that product. Fonts are served with the website.</p><h2>Links to stores and Pinterest</h2><p>When you follow an external link, that service's privacy policy applies. Affiliate networks and stores may use cookies or other identifiers to attribute purchases. The Curated Pick does not control those systems.</p><h2>Catalog assistant</h2><p>The assistant searches a copy of our published product catalog in your browser. It does not use a generative AI service or send your chat messages to us. The conversation is held in memory on the current page and is cleared when you leave or reload. Opening a suggested link makes a normal page request.</p><h2>Email</h2><p>The contact composer opens a draft in your email app; it does not submit or save your message on this website. If you contact us by email, we receive the information you choose to send and use it to respond. Do not send payment details or passwords.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL || 'curatedpick.store@gmail.com'}`}>{import.meta.env.PUBLIC_CONTACT_EMAIL || 'curatedpick.store@gmail.com'}</a> about this site's privacy practices.</p></article>
</Layout>
